                    </a>.
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-right footer-socials">
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhijitreddy75" target="_blank" aria-label="LinkedIn">
                    <i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/abhijitreddy-06" target="_blank" aria-label="GitHub">
